filament_parameters: Read user filaments from `extended/filament_library.json`

Entries from the Filament Manager's filament library override load, unload
and print temperatures and `is_soft` for their vendor/type/subtype. Values an
entry leaves out fall back to the stock tables, then to its `base_type`, so
a type the stock tables do not know (e.g. `PLA+`) still resolves `vol_speed`
instead of discarding every parameter and loading at 250 C. The file is
re-read when it changes. `FILAMENT_LIBRARY_QUERY` reports what a filament
resolves to.
---
